# Design System Components (`src/components/`)

Consumer API. Compose from `ui/` + `@/lib/tokens`.

## Form controls

- **Controlled** (`value` + `onChange` / `onValueChange`) and **uncontrolled** (`defaultValue`)
- `disabled`, `className`, `data-testid`
- Fields: `label`, `hint`, `error`, `errorMessage`, `required`

## Variants

- Product variants in `*-variants.ts` with CVA; map `SizeType` from `@/lib/tokens` when shared
- Map to `ui/` classes — no hardcoded brand colors
- Follow shadcn: export `*Variants` + `VariantProps` for extension

## Composite components (Combobox, DatePicker)

- Build from `ui/` primitives (Popover + Command, etc.)
- Folder `components/<name>/` when multiple files: `types.ts`, `*-variants.ts`, main component, `index.ts`
- Keep `ui/` free of composite logic

## Export

Each public component → types + component in `src/index.ts`.

## One component per public surface

Large features: `components/<feature>/` with internal barrel; main export still via `src/index.ts`.
